2026-06-01 16:51:24,799 - agent - INFO - middleware.py:23 - [tool monitor] 传入参数: {'query': '找出2023年每个月销售额最高的产品类别，然后从这些每月冠军类别中，找出下半年（7月到12月）销售额环比增长最快的那一类。销售额是总金额，需要按月汇总。'}
2026-06-01 16:52:11,492 - agent - INFO - middleware.py:26 - [tool monitor] 工具 generate_sql 调用成功
2026-06-01 16:52:11,494 - agent - INFO - middleware.py:38 - [log_before_model] 即将调用模型，带有 5 条消息。
2026-06-01 16:52:37,805 - agent - INFO - middleware.py:22 - [tool monitor] 执行工具: execute_sql
2026-06-01 16:52:37,805 - agent - INFO - middleware.py:23 - [tool monitor] 传入参数: {'sql': "\nWITH monthly_total AS (\n    SELECT DATE_FORMAT(`日期`, '%Y-%m') AS month, `产品类别`, SUM(`总金额`) AS total_amount\n    FROM Sheet1\n    WHERE `日期` LIKE '2023%'\n    GROUP BY DATE_FORMAT(`日期`, '%Y-%m'), `产品类别`\n),\nmonthly_champion AS (\n    SELECT month, `产品类别`, total_amount,\n           ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY month ORDER BY total_amount DESC) AS rn\n    FROM monthly_total\n),\nchampion_categories AS (\n    SELECT DISTINCT `产品类别`\n    FROM monthly_champion\n    WHERE rn = 1\n),\nhalf_year_sales AS (\n    SELECT `产品类别`, DATE_FORMAT(`日期`, '%Y-%m') AS month, SUM(`总金额`) AS monthly_amount\n    FROM Sheet1\n    WHERE `产品类别` IN (SELECT `产品类别` FROM champion_categories)\n      AND DATE_FORMAT(`日期`, '%Y-%m') BETWEEN '2023-07' AND '2023-12'\n    GROUP BY `产品类别`, DATE_FORMAT(`日期`, '%Y-%m')\n),\nmonthly_growth AS (\n    SELECT `产品类别`, month, monthly_amount,\n           LAG(monthly_amount) OVER (PARTITION BY `产品类别` ORDER BY month) AS prev_amount\n    FROM half_year_sales\n),\ngrowth_rates AS (\n    SELECT `产品类别`,\n           (monthly_amount - prev_amount) / prev_amount AS growth_rate\n    FROM monthly_growth\n    WHERE prev_amount IS NOT NULL AND prev_amount > 0\n)\nSELECT `产品类别`, AVG(growth_rate) AS avg_growth_rate\nFROM growth_rates\nGROUP BY `产品类别`\nORDER BY avg_growth_rate DESC\nLIMIT 1\n"}
2026-06-01 16:52:37,806 - agent - INFO - agent_tools.py:98 - [execute_sql] 脏数据过滤: 无
