2026-06-01 16:52:49,264 - agent - INFO - middleware.py:22 - [tool monitor] 执行工具: execute_sql
2026-06-01 16:52:49,264 - agent - INFO - middleware.py:23 - [tool monitor] 传入参数: {'sql': "\nWITH monthly_total AS (\n    SELECT DATE_FORMAT(`日期`, '%Y-%m') AS month, `产品类别`, SUM(`总金额`) AS total_amount\n    FROM Sheet1\n    WHERE `日期` LIKE '2023%'\n    GROUP BY DATE_FORMAT(`日期`, '%Y-%m'), `产品类别`\n),\nmonthly_champion AS (\n    SELECT month, `产品类别`, total_amount,\n           ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY month ORDER BY total_amount DESC) AS rn\n    FROM monthly_total\n)\nSELECT month, `产品类别`, ROUND(total_amount, 2) AS 月销售额\nFROM monthly_champion\nWHERE rn = 1\nORDER BY month\n"}
